# torch-neuronx Code Owners
#
# GitHub CODEOWNERS uses last-match-wins, so the catch-all goes FIRST
# and more specific rules override it below.
#
# Patterns are gitignore-style: an unanchored rule like `tools/` matches that
# directory at ANY depth. File and extension rules are therefore anchored with a
# leading `/` so they match only the repository root and cannot override the
# directory rules above them.
#
# Each team must exist under the org AND have write access to this repository,
# or GitHub silently ignores the rule. Verify with:
#   gh api 'repos/<org>/<repo>/codeowners/errors?ref=<branch>'
# -- Catch-all --
*                                                   @aws-neuron/torch-neuronx-approvers
# -- CODEOWNERS itself --
CODEOWNERS                                          @aws-singhada @galaind @aws-neuron/torch-neuronx-approvers
# -- C++ Runtime (default for csrc; SMEs override below) --
torch_neuronx/csrc/                                 @aws-neuron/torch-runtime-approvers @aws-neuron/torch-neuronx-approvers
